# Line endings and diff display (cycle 210).
* text=auto
*.py text eol=lf
# Byte-pinned fixtures: their digests are part of the test contract
# (the sample report's report_pair stamp; the vendored Unicode
# census), so a checkout must reproduce the blob bytes exactly on
# every platform — CRLF translation on a Windows checkout changed
# the bytes and the digests no longer matched (RR-18 follow-up,
# proven by digest arithmetic against the CI-reported value).
examples/sample-report/* binary
tests/data/* binary
# Generated/large artifacts: collapsed by default in diff views, but
# still expandable — the byte-identical golden test, not diff review,
# is what guards the sample report's contents.
examples/sample-report/* linguist-generated
pylock.toml linguist-generated
